<title>BAHRAIN: Bahraini Saudi Bank Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Bahraini Saudi Bank Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 0.89   vs    0.79</p>
<p>    Net interest income    1.26   vs    1.13</p>
<p>    Operating income	 1.47   vs    1.26</p>
<p>    Operating costs	  0.49   vs    0.46</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahraini Saudi Bank B.S.C.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is owned 50-50 by Bahraini and Saudi investors.</p>
</text>
